        "id": "business-studies-2025-05-30-shift-2-2025-05-30-2-passage001",
        "title": "Reading passage",
        "contentEn": "Shilpa Rai is a 37-year-old entrepreneur who grew up in a rural district of South Kannada. She was very good at art and craft, particularly wax molds. She loved to make candles. Often she makes toys and small pieces of art with wax and uses them as a gift for her friends and relatives. She is always involved in helping poor women of the area by providing them with jobs after imparting necessary skills. She believes that she is getting her work done as well as helping the needy section of society. Since it is a small business, she performs all the functions of business management herself. But she knows that the workers are not from a sound background, and they need motivation to perform efficiently and effectively. Slowly, the business is growing noticeably as the number of orders is increasing. As the orders are increasing, the production cost is declining. Based on the knowledge and experience that Shilpa acquired in her business, she smartly handles all the critical situations.\n\n“Based on the knowledge and experience that Shilpa acquired in her business, she smartly handles all the critical situations.”\n\nThis statement suggests that management is based on:"
      },
      {
        "id": "business-studies-2025-05-30-shift-2-2025-05-30-2-passage002",
        "title": "Reading passage",
        "contentEn": "LuxeShoe is a premium footwear brand that recently launched a new line of sneakers. Their target audience consists of young, fashion-forward individuals who are willing to spend a bit more for quality and style.\n\nLuxeShoe's marketing strategy focuses on creating an emotional connection with consumers through its branding, emphasizing comfort, durability, and sleek designs. The packaging of the shoes is carefully designed to reflect the brand's premium image, with each pair of sneakers coming in a sturdy, eco-friendly box adorned with the brand logo and minimalist graphics.\n\nThe brand uses a mix of traditional and digital marketing channels, including influencer partnerships, social media ads, and collaborations with fashion designers. Luxe Shoe also offers a loyalty program, where customers receive discounts for every purchase and referrals. The brand's strong presence in retail stores, with dedicated sections for its products, further solidifies its image as a premium brand."
      }
